      "id": "instagramTrigger_0",
      "position": {
        "x": -57.143264493127774,
        "y": 179.56676484695964
      },
      "type": "customNode",
      "data": {
        "id": "instagramTrigger_0",
        "label": "Instagram Trigger",
        "version": 1,
        "name": "instagramTrigger",
        "type": "InstagramTrigger",
        "baseClasses": [
          "InstagramTrigger",
          "triggers",
          "json",
          "string"
        ],
        "category": "Triggers",
        "description": "Real-time Instagram Direct Message (DM) webhook trigger — receives DMs and auto-replies via Meta Graph API",
        "inputParams": [
          {
            "label": "Webhook Path",
            "name": "webhookName",
            "type": "string",
            "default": "instagram",
            "description": "The unique path for your Instagram webhook URL.",
            "id": "instagramTrigger_0-input-webhookName-string"
          },
          {
            "label": "Verify Token",
            "name": "verifyToken",
            "type": "string",
            "placeholder": "e.g. my-instagram-token",
            "description": "The token you entered in the Meta Developer Portal for verification.",
            "id": "instagramTrigger_0-input-verifyToken-string"
          },
          {
            "label": "Page Access Token",
            "name": "accessToken",
            "type": "password",
            "placeholder": "e.g. EAAB...",
            "description": "Your Meta Page Access Token for direct Instagram DM auto-reply.",
            "optional": false,
            "id": "instagramTrigger_0-input-accessToken-password"
          },
          {
            "label": "Handshake Mode (Verification)",
            "name": "handshakeMode",
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "description": "Enable this during initial Meta \"Verify\" handshake. Disable after verification.",
            "id": "instagramTrigger_0-input-handshakeMode-boolean"
          },
          {
            "label": "How to Use",
            "name": "howToUse",
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "optional": true,
            "additionalParams": true,
            "hint": {
              "label": "Setup Guide",
              "value": "\n## 📸 Instagram Direct Message (DM) Setup & Token Guide\n\n### Step 1: Get Page Access Token\n1. Go to [Meta Graph API Explorer](https://developers.facebook.com/tools/explorer/).\n2. Under **Meta App**, select your App (`MicroMind Connect` or `Ranim_core_Inst`).\n3. Under **User or Page**, select **Get Page Access Token** and pick your Facebook Page.\n4. Under **Permissions**, add `instagram_basic`, `instagram_manage_messages`, and `pages_messaging`.\n5. Click **Generate Access Token** and copy the token into the **Page Access Token** field below.\n\n### Step 2: Set Meta Webhook Callback URL\n1. Copy the Webhook URL from the top of this node (`https://core.aimicromind.com/webhook/{chatflowId}/instagram`).\n2. In Meta Developer Portal ➔ **Messenger / Instagram** ➔ **Webhooks** ➔ click **Add Callback URL**.\n3. Paste the Webhook URL and enter your **Verify Token** (e.g. `insta`).\n4. Click **Verify and Save** ✅.\n5. Subscribe to `messages` and `messaging_postbacks`.\n\n### Step 3: Activate & Test Live\n1. Toggle the workflow to **ACTIVE** in the canvas header!\n2. Send an Instagram DM to your page — AI will auto-reply in real-time!\n"
            },
            "description": "Open \"Additional Parameters\" to see the setup guide.",
            "id": "instagramTrigger_0-input-howToUse-string"
          }
        ],
        "inputAnchors": [],
        "inputs": {
          "webhookName": "instagram",
          "verifyToken": "core",
          "handshakeMode": false,
          "howToUse": ""
        },
        "outputAnchors": [
          {
            "name": "output",
            "label": "Output",
            "type": "options",
            "description": "The text content of the incoming Instagram DM.",
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "instagramTrigger_0-output-text-string",
                "name": "text",
                "label": "Message Text",
                "description": "The text content of the incoming Instagram DM.",
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "id": "instagramTrigger_0-output-senderIgsid-string",
                "name": "senderIgsid",
                "label": "Sender IGSID (User ID)",
                "description": "The unique Instagram Scoped User ID of the sender.",
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "id": "instagramTrigger_0-output-fullData-json",
                "name": "fullData",
                "label": "Full Data (Smart Object)",
                "description": "Returns object with text, senderIgsid, and timestamp for prompt mapping.",
                "type": "json"
              }
            ],
            "default": "text"
          }
        ],
        "outputs": {
          "output": "text"
        },
